{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_027FF0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"现在是一个人生活吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"不。上了中学以后，我就住在学校宿舍。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"妈妈死后亲戚收留了我……但毕竟不是真正的家人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"住得不自在吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":"JPN_DISCOMFORT_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"是啊……姨妈们在我面前都对我很好，可是……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"不过，我想突然要收养一个孩子，她们肯定也很为难。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"住在一起就没法隐瞒。我还是能感觉到，自己给她们添了麻烦……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"看来你吃了不少苦。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"不。光是有人肯收留我，我就已经很感激了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"JPN_GRATITUDE_NOT_LUCK_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"有些<R=私生子,Bastard>在母亲去世后会沦为街头儿童，内战频发的国家就更惨了。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=私生子,Bastard>","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"RUBY_LOCALIZED;AUX_ORPHAN_MISTRANSLATION_CORRECTED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"我这点经历还算不上不幸。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":"JPN_LITERAL_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"你很坚强啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"……不。我一点也不坚强。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""}]}